{
  "id": "orifice_air_discharge_vs__pressure",
  "title": "Orifice Air Discharge vs. Pressure",
  "description": "Nozzles discharging air volume. Calculate air leakage or air volume passing through orifices ranging from 1/64 to 1/4 inches. For well rounded nozzles multiply the diagram values by 0.97. For sharp edged nozzles multiply the values by 0.65.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Conversion Factors\n\n- 1 psig = 6.9 kPa = 0.069 bar\n- 1 inch = 25.4 mm\n- 1 scfm = 0.472 nl/s\n\n## Nozzle Types\n\n- **Well rounded nozzles**: Multiply diagram values by 0.97\n- **Sharp edged nozzles**: Multiply diagram values by 0.65"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "orifice_size_inches",
          "label": "Orifice Size",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "inches",
          "defaultValue": 0.125
        },
        {
          "id": "pressure_psig",
          "label": "Pressure",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "psig",
          "defaultValue": 40
        },
        {
          "id": "nozzle_type",
          "label": "Nozzle Type",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "Well Rounded",
              "value": 0.97
            },
            {
              "label": "Sharp Edged",
              "value": 0.65
            }
          ],
          "defaultValue": 0.97
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "pressure_kpa",
          "label": "Pressure",
          "unit": "kPa",
          "formula": "inputs.pressure_psig * 6.9"
        },
        {
          "id": "pressure_bar",
          "label": "Pressure",
          "unit": "bar",
          "formula": "inputs.pressure_psig * 0.069"
        },
        {
          "id": "orifice_size_mm",
          "label": "Orifice Size",
          "unit": "mm",
          "formula": "inputs.orifice_size_inches * 25.4"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}